        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 90,
            "printedPage": 82
          }
        ],
        "text": "Paranthaman's chapter of pardon for sins.",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s075-u003",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "கருடன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s075-d002",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 90,
            "printedPage": 82
          }
        ],
        "text": "Hmm, newspaper fellows will write like that. Can we be afraid of all that?",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s075-u004",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பரந்தாமன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s075-d003",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 90,
            "printedPage": 82
          }
        ],
        "text": "They say my honour itself has been destroyed because I asked forgiveness.",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s075-u005",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "கருடன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s075-d004",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 91,
            "printedPage": 83
          }
        ],
        "text": "Some honour! If a man's honour is destroyed merely by asking forgiveness, there's no need for such honour to exist at all.",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s075-u006",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பரந்தாமன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s075-d005",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 91,
            "printedPage": 83
          }
        ],
        "text": "Bravo.",
        "notes": []
      }
    ]
  }
